<Layout
  title="Our Restaurants | Toile Blanche"
  description="Toile Blanche Le Restaurant, La Guinguette de Toile Blanche"
  ogImage="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/639af6c370637a9be3e3b0b0/63dbc14a7fa59e1233dd4d93_Neutral%20Beige%20Minimalist%20Photo%20Collage%20Facebook%20Cover%20(1).jpg"
>
  <Nav theme="both" />

  <div class="hero3" style="opacity:0"><div class="hero-image-wrapper"><img alt="" class="hero-image" height="Auto" loading="eager" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-cc1d88d7ddf7f1.jpg"/></div><div class="hero-image-overlay"></div><div class="hero-content-wrapper"><div class="hero-content" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0"><div class="subtitle light">Gastronomy</div><h1 class="light">BELOVED FLAVOURS OF THE Med</h1><div class="hero-paragraph"><p class="light">Savour indulgent and pure cuisine inspired by the season and the verdant Mediterranean terrain at our two restaurants. Here you can unwind in a relaxed environment surrounded by a Provencal oasis, as the hectic pace outside the domain fades away like a distant memory.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="section padding-192"><div class="container"><div class="heading-wrapper inner-spacing"><h2>Where Culinary meets authenticity</h2></div><div class="hero-paragraph"><p class="feature-paragraph medium-width">In the morning, tuck into a well-balanced continental breakfast by the pool, as you plan your day ahead.<br/><br/>Opt for a light lunch at La Guinguette, loved by locals for its delectable sharing plates and undeniable holiday vibe. As the sun sets over the domain, install yourself on Le Restaurant’s terrace for a more elaborate menu with breathtaking views of the valley.<br/><br/>Both restaurants are set in an informal atmosphere. Dietary requirements? Let us know! Our amiable staff will do everything to fulfil all your wishes.<br/><br/></p></div><div class="divider _96px"></div><div class="w-layout-grid grid-split-section _2row"><div class="image-container large-height right-padding"><img alt="" class="card-image" loading="eager" src="/assets/images/page-img-881f5ac258ef50.avif"/></div><div class="content-container right-padding"><div class="main-content-wrapper"><h3>Le Petit-Déjeuner</h3><p class="paragraph-9">Whether you're an early bird wishing to start the day as soon as possible, or a late riser, you can choose the kind of breakfast you desire.</p></div><div class="btn-wrapper"><a class="button secondary w-button" href="breakfast-at-toile-blanche.html">Discover Now</a></div></div><div class="content-container right-padding"><div class="main-content-wrapper"><h3>Le Restaurant <br/>de Toile Blanche</h3><p class="paragraph-10">Le Restaurant focuses on pure flavours with some surprising touches. The Mediterranean has an incredible array of produce to offer, especially when it comes to seafood, vegetables, herbs, and fruit. A real joy for the kitchen. The sophistication is found in the simplicity of the dishes.</p></div><div class="btn-wrapper"><a class="button secondary w-button" href="https://restaurant.toileblanche.com/" target="_blank">Discover Now</a></div></div><div class="image-container large-height left-padding"><img alt="" class="card-image" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 90vw, (max-width: 1439px) 85vw, 75vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-14433f29c9500d.jpg"/></div><div class="image-container large-height right-padding"><img alt="" class="card-image" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 90vw, (max-width: 1439px) 85vw, 75vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-7f72d09199a7a2.jpg"/></div><div class="content-container left-padding"><div class="main-content-wrapper"><h3>La Guinguette <br/>de Toile Blanche</h3><p class="paragraph-11">La Guinguette is the place where you can order some sharing plates with friends, meet and mingle with other guests, or have a small bite with a chilled glass of rosé wine in between two tanning sessions. The summer vibe is very present here, so feel at ease arriving bare foot, or lightly dressed–always in style, obviously.</p></div><div class="btn-wrapper"><a class="button secondary w-button" href="https://guinguette.toileblanche.com/" target="_blank">Discover Now</a></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="full-frame-image-wrapper"><div class="full-frame-image-content"></div></div></div><div class="section bottom-padding-192"><div class="container"><div class="heading-wrapper inner-spacing div-block"><h2>Our Suites</h2></div></div><div class="rooms-collection-list-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div class="room-flex-thirds w-dyn-items" role="list"><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="suites/penequet.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Villa du Pénéquet" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 90vw, (max-width: 767px) 27vw, (max-width: 991px) 28vw, (max-width: 1439px) 29vw, 26vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-5f8a45f5b552ed.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Villa du Pénéquet</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="suites/suite-petanque.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Suite Pétanque" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 90vw, (max-width: 767px) 27vw, (max-width: 991px) 28vw, (max-width: 1439px) 29vw, 26vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-833a78c568fe35.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Suite Pétanque</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="suites/suite-cabanat.html"><div class="collection-image-wrappe